1. Severe-weather warnings: AEMET OpenData

   Terms:  https://www.aemet.es/es/nota_legal
   Reuse:  commercial and non-commercial reuse allowed.
   Credit: for modified data, name AEMET as the owner with "Fuente: AEMET",
           and state the date of the last update.
   How:    "Fuente: AEMET" in the `attribution` member; the last update is
           `last_success_at` in /v1/sources/status. The AEMET technical
           content (phenomenon, level, validity window, zone) is kept as
           published, in `properties.attrs`.

